===Etymology===
{{ety|en|:inh|enm:probleme|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|probleme}}, from {{der|en|frm|probleme}}, from {{der|en|la|problēma}}, from {{der|en|grc|πρόβλημα|t=anything thrown forward, hindrance, obstacle, anything projecting, a headland, promontory}}, from {{m|grc|προβάλλω|t=to throw or lay something in front of someone, to put forward}}, from {{m|grc|προ-|t=in front of}} + {{m|grc|βάλλω|t=to throw, to cast, to hurl}}. {{doublet|en|problema}}.

